;\">616牛肉火鍋專門店</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">地址：尖沙咀赫德道4號The Hart 1樓</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4cddc7e0-f2b4-4c04-844d-6df43c41c167.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026FCk7mddRFY1788773563.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4cddc7e0-f2b4-4c04-844d-6df43c41c167.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"f063a606-758d-46d8-a4a7-9c9d3b8f3964.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026zXLiBo6TWU1788773563.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"f063a606-758d-46d8-a4a7-9c9d3b8f3964.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9b43c500-7793-47e5-8bb4-f85e5e205d60.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/upload